# v4/_redirects
# Clean, role-based entry URLs for the CRM/admin area. HTTP-200 rewrites --
# the browser's address bar keeps the clean URL; the body comes from the
# existing physical file in admin/. Every page referenced here already has
# its own client-side role check via GET /api/auth/me (unauthorized visits
# get redirected to /admin, the shared login page, by that page's own JS).
#
# Targets deliberately omit the .html extension: Cloudflare Pages
# auto-redirects every *.html file to its extensionless form (a platform
# behavior independent of this file, confirmed via curl against files with
# no _redirects rule at all involved). Rewriting to the .html path would
# chain into a second 308 redirect to the extensionless path, which changes
# the visible URL away from the clean one this file exists to keep stable
# -- so every target here already uses the form Cloudflare would redirect
# to anyway, avoiding that extra hop.

